+# How far the final pose may sit from the STORED HOME DATUM, in degrees.
+#
+# Separate from PITCH_VERIFY_TOL_DEG, and the distinction is the whole point.
+# PITCH_VERIFY_TOL_DEG asks "are we at true vertical", which on this rig is a
+# question whose answer is permanently NO: measured 2026-09-20, home sits
+# 4.40 deg from vertical and ~2 deg of that is ROLL, which the mechanism has
